fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"additional/design/machine-learning-analytics.html#prepost-processing-negotiation","fragment":"Pre/Post Processing Negotiation\nAllowing the negotiation of required analysis pre/post-processing and automatically injecting the required elements to enable their processing would be very valuable and minimize the effort of porting an analytics pipeline between different platforms and making use of available acceleration. Tensor-decoders bin, auto-plugging of pre-processing (considering available acceleration), auto-plugging of inference element (optimized for the platform), post-processing, tensor-decoder bin selecting required tensor-decoders potentially from multiple functionally equivalent, but more adapted to the platform, are all aspects to consider when designing negotiation involved in an analytics pipeline.\n"});